flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets HOME, which the launch sets for every session. Of the launch's own variables only PATH may be set here.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets TERM, which the launch sets for every session. Of the launch's own variables only PATH may be set here.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets PWD, which the launch sets for every session. Of the launch's own variables only PATH may be set here.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets TINI_SUBREAPER, which tini, the session's init, reads: the payload's environment is tini's too, and how the session's init behaves is the launch's, not the container's.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets NIX_PATH to a value holding `${NIX_PATH}`. A value may refer only to ${HOME}, ${USER}, ${LOGNAME}, ${SHELL}, ${XDG_RUNTIME_DIR} and ${TMPDIR}, which the launch fills in, and spells a `$` as `$$`: nothing runs a shell to expand anything else.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets WHO to a value holding `$(`. A value may refer only to ${HOME}, ${USER}, ${LOGNAME}, ${SHELL}, ${XDG_RUNTIME_DIR} and ${TMPDIR}, which the launch fills in, and spells a `$` as `$$`: nothing runs a shell to expand anything else.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets BARE to a value holding `$HOME`. A value may refer only to ${HOME}, ${USER}, ${LOGNAME}, ${SHELL}, ${XDG_RUNTIME_DIR} and ${TMPDIR}, which the launch fills in, and spells a `$` as `$$`: nothing runs a shell to expand anything else.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets DEFAULTED to a value holding `${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}`. A value may refer only to ${HOME}, ${USER}, ${LOGNAME}, ${SHELL}, ${XDG_RUNTIME_DIR} and ${TMPDIR}, which the launch fills in, and spells a `$` as `$$`: nothing runs a shell to expand anything else.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets "A=B", which is not a variable's name: it is empty or holds a `=`.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets "", which is not a variable's name: it is empty or holds a `=`.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-environment-for-a-shell.zon: flong.box.environment sets WHO twice.
